sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Electron Renderer
    participant Main as Preload / Main
    participant Host as Agent Host
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Pi as Pi SDK
    User->>UI: Send new message
    UI->>Main: sendMessage(conversationId, requestId, text)
    Main->>Host: JSONL command
    Host->>DB: Commit message, Task, TaskRun and events
    Host-->>Main: Accepted IDs
    Host->>Pi: Open saved session and start new Attempt
    Pi-->>Host: Text, tools, usage
    Host->>DB: Commit reply delta, tool receipt and conversation event
    Host-->>Main: Conversation event by seq
    Main-->>UI: Update projection
    User->>UI: Stop
    UI->>Main: stopConversation
    Main->>Host: Stop command
    Host->>DB: Commit stop intent
    Host->>Pi: Stop at tool or model boundary
    Pi-->>Host: Settle and flush session
    Host->>DB: Commit stopped or needs_reconciliation
    Host-->>UI: Terminal state through Main
    UI->>Host: History via Main after restart
    Host-->>UI: Snapshot and exclusive event cursor
